# Assets & in-addon packaging hygiene

Zip/install/CI: `build-packaging.mdc`. This rule covers files **inside** the addon tree.

## Non-negotiables

- TOC can only load files under `ChurchOfBeef/` — keep media next to code
- Missing custom fonts/textures/sounds must **not** fail load; fall back to default UI
- Quiet by default — no auto-invite, auto-whisper, or ambient `/g` spam

## Paths

- Stable addon-relative paths; never assume Classic Era AddOns/WTF trees
- Consistent casing on disk and in TOC

## Fallbacks / media

- `/beef` frame must still exist if custom media is missing
- Custom Media is permitted and expected **on theatrical surfaces** (Law 10 / Bible §19.3)
- Do not bundle ripped Blizzard soundtrack files

## Consent / hygiene

- Stream-safe defaults: no surprise dumps of officer notes or alt lists
- No ads, tip jars, or donation CTAs in the game UI
